    "title": "Barry Alvarez recalls the magic of Lou Holtz, Jerry Fishbain - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Lucas ,\n19 hours ago One of the last times former University of Wisconsin football coach Barry Alvarez saw Lou Holtz was when his Notre Dame mentor was in Madison for a fundraiser. During the speaking engagement, Holtz pulled off his favorite magic trick with a newspaper, a motivational demonstration he had often used in front of players. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
